(295, 299, 'GUE723482883326', 'Rebecca ', 'Mills-Robertson', NULL, '2005-04-19', 'Female', 'Ghanaian', '0543439065', 'millsrobertsonrebecca5@gmail.com', 'CE-008-1671', 'Central', 'Effutu (Winneba)', 'University of Education, Winneba', 'BSc. Business Administration (Human Resource Management)', '2026', 'Central', 'Effutu (Winneba)', NULL, NULL, '2026', '2026-10-05', '2027-10-05', 'passport/299-rebecca-mills-robertson/1791507424713_passport_photo_compressed.jpeg', 'id_card/299-rebecca-mills-robertson/1791507425011_Ghana_Card_compressed.jpeg', 'appointment/299-rebecca-mills-robertson/1791507426605_REBECCA_MILLS-ROBERTSON_Posting_Letter.pdf', 'cv/299-rebecca-mills-robertson/1791507426800_Rebecca_Mills-Robertson_CV.pdf', 'I undertook my attachment at the DVLA Premium Office, where I was involved in capturing and recapturing, issuing of premium cards, passing of eye test, and booking of printed license information, eye test, new driving license and renewal records.\n\nI also did my internship at the Administration Office, where I recorded letters received in the register, issued standard cards, booked printed license information, gathered recaptures for recapturing, and called clients for collection of their ready cards.\n\nI am familiar with DVLA operations and ready to serve diligently during my National Service.', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-10-09 00:57:06', '2026-10-09 00:57:06'),
