n and assignment. You are expected to exhibit good conduct and abide by all rules and regulations of the Authority throughout your service period.\",\"salaryGrade\":\"DVLA Grade 7 Step 1\",\"probationPeriod\":\"six (6) months\",\"contractDuration\":\"two (2) years\",\"signatoryName\":\"EPHRAIM NII TAN SACKEY\",\"signatoryTitle\":\"AG. DIRECTOR HR\",\"signatoryForTitle\":\"FOR: CHIEF EXECUTIVE\",\"ccText\":\"Head of Department/Unit/Office\"},\"smsHistory\":[{\"type\":\"approved\",\"sentAt\":\"2026-10-20T14:56:44.384Z\",\"phone\":\"0551996498\",\"success\":true,\"message\":\"Dear Abubakar Siddique  Adamu, congratulations! Your DVLA NSS application has been successfully approved. Visit https://nss.dvla.gov.gh to log in and download your appointment letter. NB: Use Chrome to download your appointment letter.\"}]}', 'approved', 11, NULL, '2026-10-20 14:56:51', '2026-10-10 09:36:46', '2026-10-20 14:56:50'),
