(58, 'Ibrahim Ibra', '0544243519', 'I am writing to request assistance with correcting my station selection on the new NSS DVLA portal. After being posted by the National Service Authority (NSA) to DVLA, I mistakenly selected Mampong as my preferred station instead of the Asokore Mampong  that is, the Regional Head Office around airport roundabout, which is closer to my residence. I would be grateful if you could kindly remove my current station selection or posting from the portal and allow me to reapply to the appropriate station closer to me. I apologize for the mistake and would appreciate your assistance in resolving this issue so I can complete the process correctly. Thank you for your time and support.', 'in_progress', '2026-10-18 11:45:30', '2026-10-20 11:21:32'),
