(67, 'Samuel Akoto', '0542250751', 'Good morning , please. I’m kindly reaching out to ask for your assistance regarding my NSS application. My portal is still pending approval and validation will end in no time , and I honestly don’t know who else to turn to for help with the process.\n\nI have completed my BSc in Statistical Data Science at UMaT, and this delay has been worrying me a lot. My dad is beginning to think I haven’t actually graduated because everything is still pending, and it’s really painful having to explain the situation when I’m genuinely trying to move forward with my life.\n\nPlease, if there is any way you could assist me with the approval and validation of my application, I would be very grateful. I have also sent an email concerning this issue, but I wanted to reach out here as well in the hope that someone could kindly guide me or help me resolve it.\n\nI sincerely apologise for any inconvenience, and I would deeply appreciate any assistance you can offer. Thank you very much for your time and understanding.', 'open', '2026-10-19 10:39:17', '2026-10-19 10:39:17'),
