(104, 'Erica Yankey', '0536923433', 'Please my name is Erica Yankey with NSS number (NSS 369707). Please I was posted to DVLA Winneba District for my National service and was asked to register on the DVLA portal. Please it\'s been over a week now and my application is still pending. Please my application has not been reviewed by the Admin. And since it has not  been reviewed there\'s no appointment letter for me to download neither is there a release letter from the authority for me to download on the portal. Please any assistance? I learnt we are supposed to start on 2nd November, 2026, which before then I would have to go to region for the regional register. Please I really need your help. At this point I don\'t know whether my application would be approved or I would be given a release letter. Please your urgent assistance would be really appreciated. Thank you for your swift response.', 'open', '2026-10-22 12:51:40', '2026-10-22 12:51:40'),
