(108, 'Saviour Sarfo Amponsah', '0591759581', 'Dear DVLA Support Team,\n\nMy name is Saviour Sarfo Amponsah, a National Service person assigned to DVLA. I submitted my request on the DVLA NSS Portal on 12 October 2026, but the status still shows \"Pending\" and I have received no update since then.\n\nMy details: university of cape coast \nBachelor of education ( social sciences) \nGeography major \nPlace of posting: sekyere east\nDistrict: sekyere east district\nRegion: Ashanti\nYear of enrollment: 2026/2027\nRemarks: posted-awaiting acceptance.\nFull Name: Saviour Sarfo Amponsah\nPhone: 0591759581\nNSS Number: [GUCC718049275526]\n\nI kindly request that you review my submission and advise me on whether any further action is needed from my side. I will gladly provide any additional information or documents required.\n\nThank you for your assistance.\n\nYours faithfully,\nSaviour Sarfo Amponsah', 'open', '2026-10-22 15:12:20', '2026-10-22 15:12:20'),
(109, 'Gloria Manu', '0545083720', 'Good morning\nPlease,I submitted my nss application through the portal on 8th October but up until now it has not been approved.\nI would like to know if there is any issue with my application that is causing the delay. I would be grateful if you could kindly look into it and assist me .', 'open', '2026-10-23 00:13:59', '2026-10-23 00:13:59'),
(110, 'Gloria Manu', '0545083720', 'Good morning\nPlease,I submitted my nss application through the portal on 8th October but up until now it has not been approved.\nI would like to know if there is any issue with my application that is causing the delay. I would be grateful if you could kindly look into it and assist me .\nI don’t know if I should do a follow up at the head office because the last time I went there I was told to do everything relating to the the nss on the portal', 'open', '2026-10-23 00:16:26', '2026-10-23 00:16:26'),
(111, 'RASHIDATU suley', '0543647998', 'How long does it take to get a letter from DVLA after application', 'open', '2026-10-23 07:29:34', '2026-10-23 07:29:34'),
(112, 'Eric Ofori Darko', '0248571756', 'Good day \nPlease my application has been on pending since Tuesday and today is the deadline for Nss', 'open', '2026-10-23 08:49:00', '2026-10-23 08:49:00'),
(113, 'Boadu Evans Osei', '0208110401', 'Please it’s been 2 weeks and i still have bo feedback on what’s going on, the review haven’t been completed yet and it’s taking awhile. Please kindly give me a feedback on when i will get my appointment letter', 'open', '2026-10-23 11:44:12', '2026-10-23 11:44:12'),
(114, 'Bless Dickson', '0598119040', 'Good afternoon , please. My name is Bless Dickson. I visited the DVLA office in Cape Coast and submitted my National Service appointment letter, which was received by an officer.\nLater that day, I was sent a registration link, which I successfully completed. However, my application status has remained “Admin Review (In Queue)” for over a week now.\nPlease, I would like to kindly inquire about the progress of my application and whether there is anything further I need to do.\nI would be very grateful for your assistance. Thank you.', 'open', '2026-10-23 13:31:02', '2026-10-23 13:31:02'),
(115, 'Agartha Agyemang', '0248442929', 'The NSS site currently instructs personnel to download their letter using Google Chrome. However, when following this instruction and attempting to access or download the letter in Chrome, the system returns an error message stating “invalid email or password\'\'\n\nThis creates a clear contradiction: the official guidance directs users to Chrome, yet Chrome is unable to authenticate the same credentials that the system should accept. As a result, legitimate users are blocked from accessing important correspondence that the NSS platform itself is supposed to provide.\n\nThis problem has caused unnecessary delay and inconvenience. It also undermines confidence in the reliability of the NSS portal and the accuracy of the guidance published on the site.\n\nI request that you:\n1. Investigate why the Chrome download route is producing authentication failures.\n2. Either correct the technical issue so that Chrome works as instructed, or update the on screen guidance so that it no longer directs users to a method that fails.\n3. Provide a reliable alternative method for downloading letters that does not rely on a broken Chrome pathway.\n\nPlease acknowledge this complaint and advise me of the steps being taken to resolve it, along with an expected timeframe.', 'resolved', '2026-10-23 14:09:09', '2026-10-26 13:15:57'),
(116, 'Abdul Rahaman', '0591786289', 'I want to edit my submitted form', 'open', '2026-10-23 18:06:25', '2026-10-23 18:06:25'),
(117, 'Eugene Frimpong', '0554754818', 'Please I have submitted my documents for the past one  to two weeks even I submitted mine first than some of my colleagues and they have been accepted with their letters in their portals ,most of them have even finish with their validation proces, please I beg you in the name of Almighty God  kindly help me get mine with positive response , my father is no more my mom  also I don\'t have anyone to support me please and a big please kindly do something about it for me thank you and God bless you more 🙏', 'open', '2026-10-24 07:08:22', '2026-10-24 07:08:22'),
(118, 'Eugene Frimpong', '0554754818', 'Please here is my posting tracking number Please help  me (GAD002730090926 ,I beg you in the name of God kindly do me favor I know it may sound quite disturbing but I think because I don\'t have any support that is the reason why mine have kept long help me with positive responses so that I can work with you and serve my Nationa with passion God bless you All thank you 🙏', 'open', '2026-10-24 07:24:02', '2026-10-24 07:24:02'),
(119, 'Henry Emmanuel Fosu', '233249257527', 'Hello sir/madam \nDVLA subsequently assigned me to the Mampong office even though I selected Kumasi metro. I respectfully request management’s assistance in reviewing this assignment and considering me for placement at Kumasi Municipal DVLA in line with my original posting. Thank you for your understanding and consideration.\nNSS Number:  GKTU727487587526', 'open', '2026-10-24 14:33:02', '2026-10-24 14:33:02'),
(120, 'Agartha Agyemang', '0248442929', 'Please, I’ve been trying to log in to my portal, but it keeps showing invalid email or password. I’ve changed my password several times, but I’m still getting the same error. Please, can you help me resolve this issue?', 'open', '2026-10-24 21:44:51', '2026-10-24 21:44:51'),
(121, 'Irene Sekum', '0591400340', 'Please I think my NSS posting is delaying.  My place of posting is CAPE COAST DVLA office', 'open', '2026-10-25 12:59:25', '2026-10-25 12:59:25'),
