(133, 'Samuel Anokye', '0248925100', 'Good day, please, I submitted my information last month, but I have still not received my approval. Some people who submitted theirs around the same time have already received theirs, so I am kindly asking for your help to check the status of my application.\n\nI would be very grateful if you could look into my application and help me get the necessary approval. Thank you for your time and assistance. 🙏', 'open', '2026-10-29 09:59:13', '2026-10-29 09:59:13'),
