(137, 'Patricia Appiah', '0540954385', 'Please I was posted to DVLA for my national service but up to now my application is still on pending so I want to know if I have a chance there or not then I\'ll take my next step.  Thank you', 'open', '2026-10-29 12:06:45', '2026-10-29 12:06:45'),
(138, 'Owuraku Agyeman Osei', '0202309375', 'Please my application is still on pending. I came to regional office today and they told me it needs approval from head office. As the national service commencement date is next week, I would be grateful if you could kindly assist in expediting the approval process and issuing my acceptance. Thank you', 'open', '2026-10-29 12:26:12', '2026-10-29 12:26:12'),
