(140, 'Eugene Asare', '0257149839', 'Please I have been waiting for my approval in order to carry on for National Service but it is still not yet in and most of my colleagues have started.\nKindly help me with out receive mine.\nBelow are my credentials:\n\nNAME:Asare Eugene\n\nNSS NUMBER:\nGUE728123676426\n\nINSTITUTION:\nUniversity of Education, Winneba\n\nPROGRAM:\nB.A GEOGRAPHY EDUCATION \n\nOFFICE POSTED: DRIVER AND VEHICLE LICENSING AUTHORITY (DVLA) EFFUTU,WINNEBA BRANCH.\n\nWish to hear from you.\nThank you.', 'open', '2026-10-30 11:48:24', '2026-10-30 11:48:24'),
(141, 'Sajida Yakubu Buriyala', '0549527746', 'I\'m facing a challenge on submitting my application', 'open', '2026-10-31 09:38:29', '2026-10-31 09:38:29'),
(142, 'Sampson Nseboh', '0556314609', 'Please I registered for the NSS on the platform, and it been 8 days science I registered and it’s still under admin review. I wanted clarification on how long it takes for the admin review to be done. Thank you', 'open', '2026-10-31 11:41:59', '2026-10-31 11:41:59'),
(143, 'Addo Godwin', '0554883898', 'Good day Sir/Madam,\n\nI am writing to seek your kind assistance regarding my portal registration, which has been pending for about a month now.\n\nI recently completed my studies and have been posted to Bremang UGC DVLA for my National Service. I am worried and discouraged by the delay, as I sincerely wish to begin my service.\n\nI would be very grateful if you could kindly look into my request and help me resolve this issue.\n\nThank you for your time and understanding. I sincerely hope for your assistance.', 'open', '2026-11-02 00:31:52', '2026-11-02 00:31:52'),
(144, 'Abdulrahim Sualah', '0595371159', 'Please I have not gotten any feedback about my nss posting in the portal whether I have been accepted or rejected', 'open', '2026-11-02 09:02:26', '2026-11-02 09:02:26');
